direction: right
OrderAPI: Order API {shape: rectangle}
Saga: Saga orchestrator {shape: hexagon}
Inventory: Inventory service {shape: rectangle}
Payment: Payment service {shape: rectangle}
Shipping: Shipping service {shape: rectangle}
Orders: Order database {shape: cylinder}
Events: Saga events {shape: queue}
OrderAPI -> Saga: start order
Saga -> Inventory: reserve
Inventory -> Saga: reserved
Saga -> Payment: charge
Payment -> Saga: charged
Saga -> Shipping: create shipment
Shipping -> Saga: accepted
Saga -> Orders: complete
Saga -> Events: state changes
Saga -> Inventory: compensate release
Saga -> Payment: compensate refund
